# Accepted Trivy findings, each with its reason (docs/adr/0002-aws-account-type.md).

# AVD-AWS-0132 (HIGH): S3 without a customer-managed KMS key.
# All buckets use SSE-S3 (architecture §12). A KMS key costs ~$1/month on its own, which is
# the whole monthly budget; the data is public timetable data, model files and the website.
AVD-AWS-0132

# AVD-AWS-0089 (LOW): S3 access logging disabled.
# Server access logs need a second bucket and add storage/request cost; CloudTrail management
# events cover who changed what. Revisit in Phase 10 (hardening).
AVD-AWS-0089
